cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or refer to this work, please cite the paper below."
title: >-
  Insuring Unemployment Out of Your Own Pension: Causal Evidence from Mexico's
  Retiro Parcial por Desempleo
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and manuscripts for a study of the labor market effects of Mexico's
  Retiro Parcial por Desempleo (RPD), which allows unemployed workers to withdraw
  pension savings. The estimates come from administrative social-security records
  and a fuzzy regression discontinuity design around the two-year contribution
  eligibility threshold.
type: software
